  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REIMAGINING SCHOOL AND ITS ENVIRONMENT. INTEGRAL MODEL FOR DEVELOPMENT, PROTECTION AND LEARNING OF CHILDREN AND ADOLESCENTS IN HONDURAS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve access to and permanence in school, as well as learning, development, and protection for especially vulnerable children and adolescents in Honduras, through a local action model integrated into public policies and scalable for the entire country.&#x25a3; &#xc131;&#xacfc; 1. 502&#xac1c; &#xd559;&#xad50;&#xc758; &#xb2e4;&#xbd84;&#xc57c; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xae30;&#xcd08;&#xad50;&#xc721; &#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xac1c;&#xc120; &#xbc0f; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
&#x25a3; &#xc131;&#xacfc; 2. 80&#xac1c; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xc758; &#xb2e4;&#xbd84;&#xc57c; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xac1c;&#xc120; &#xbc0f; &#xc815;&#xbd80;&#xc758; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of water sanitation and healthcare system for 80 local community in Hondruas, social protection for adolescent mothers, Improvement of water sanitation and protection from violence through supports on 500 schools and kindergarden in the region, Improvement of inter-sectoral cooperation to ensure the inclusive development action model</narrative>
  </description>
